repository-code: "https://github.com/KarmirisP/aest-nonseparable-cosmology"
url: "https://github.com/KarmirisP/aest-nonseparable-cosmology"

abstract: >
  Reproducibility software, modified CLASS implementation, numerical
  configuration, publication figures, validation evidence, and manuscript
  materials for the revised matched seven-likelihood analysis of the cyclic,
  nonlinear zero-particle-CDM single-metric relativistic modified-gravity
  cosmology. The matched comparison uses Planck 2018 high-l TTTEEE-lite,
  low-l TT, low-l EE, Planck lensing, DESI DR2 BAO, Pantheon+, and SH0ES.

keywords:
  - modified gravity
  - cosmology
  - AeST
  - cyclic cosmology
  - nonlinear gravity
  - zero-particle-CDM
  - CLASS
  - DESI DR2
  - Planck
  - Pantheon+
  - SH0ES
